{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239360/extras/c230b7580f69ef7a03ff3d7b995e3a4f.poster.avif?t=1772497593\" width=800 height=98 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239360/extras/c230b7580f69ef7a03ff3d7b995e3a4f.webm?t=1772497593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239360/extras/c230b7580f69ef7a03ff3d7b995e3a4f.mp4?t=1772497593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Heart has lost its guiding voice and disappeared alongside it. In its wake, it left a mess of Amalgamation, twisting and corrupting the matter of the Psyche. The Heart's guardian puppet, Peccori, is left to pick up the pieces. Become the Peccori's guiding pulse through action-platformer levels where every slash, jump and combo is guided by the music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239360/extras/5d288fa85cb48ae48f4099098438d6c2.poster.avif?t=1772497593\" width=800 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239360/extras/5d288fa85cb48ae48f4099098438d6c2.webm?t=1772497593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239360/extras/5d288fa85cb48ae48f4099098438d6c2.mp4?t=1772497593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your attacks' momentum to dash through enemies and reach new heights! String together air combos, discover new enemy types, and draw ever closer to uncovering the mystery of the Heart's disappearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239360/extras/a966b34b99fce654257b3e8e8f67c5ee.poster.avif?t=1772497593\" width=800 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239360/extras/a966b34b99fce654257b3e8e8f67c5ee.webm?t=1772497593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239360/extras/a966b34b99fce654257b3e8e8f67c5ee.mp4?t=1772497593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239360/extras/5484418eb2b36113cdaf1b129497f73b.poster.avif?t=1772497593\" width=800 height=98 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239360/extras/5484418eb2b36113cdaf1b129497f73b.webm?t=1772497593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239360/extras/5484418eb2b36113cdaf1b129497f73b.mp4?t=1772497593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Beat, Heart, Beat</i> is a surreal, reflective journey backed by a grungy alt-rock soundtrack. Explore handcrafted cutscenes, recruit bizarre characters, and explore new corners of the Psyche at each step in your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239360/extras/d0a5321f29d8c1d330b74cc4b289d256.poster.avif?t=1772497593\" width=800 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse